KinderCare is not a different product. It is the same application as
[EduConnect](/docs/educonnect-overview), deployed for kindergartens instead of schools, with
different wording, different defaults and a different set of screens switched on.

## What that means in practice

**The staff dashboard is the same dashboard.** Classes, students, attendance, staff, fees and
reporting all work exactly as the EduConnect section of this guide describes. If you are looking for
how to add a class, take a payment or close the day, read it there — none of it is different.

What changes:

- **Terminology** — "Kindergarten" rather than "School" in places, set per institute. See
  [Why Terminology Changes Between Institutes](/docs/shared-institute-branding).
- **Which screens appear** — a kindergarten typically has no timetable grid or exam results, so
  those parts of the drawer are simply not switched on.
- **Two mobile apps**, which schools do not have.

## The two mobile apps

This is the real difference, and the reason KinderCare has its own section at all.

| App | Who uses it | What it's for |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **KinderCare staff app** | Teachers and assistants | Recording what each child did during the day — activities, photos, learning outcomes — plus enrolment and the calendar |
| **KinderCare parent app** | Parents | Seeing those observations, themes, the calendar and payments, for one child or several |

Schools use the web **parent portal** for the equivalent; kindergartens use the parent app.

The staff app is where day-to-day kindergarten practice actually happens — a photo and a note
against a learning outcome, several times a day, per child. The web dashboard is for the office.

## Where to go next

- Kindergarten staff, on the phone:
  [Getting Started with the KinderCare Staff App](/docs/kindercare-staff-getting-started)
- Recording the day: [Recording Activities](/docs/kindercare-staff-activities)
- End of week or month: [Writing Reports](/docs/kindercare-staff-reports)
- Parents: [The KinderCare Parent App](/docs/kindercare-parent-app)
- Office staff on the web dashboard: the whole
  [EduConnect section](/docs/educonnect-overview) applies to you
